            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "SIDE LETTER AGREEMENT\nBETWEEN THE UNIVERSITY OF CALIFORNIA AND THE\nAMERICAN FEDERATION OF STATE, COUNTY, AND MUNICIPAL EMPLOYEES (AFSCME)\nREGARDING UNIVERSITY BENEFITS",
            "block_bbox": [
                143,
                566,
